      <div class="longform">
        <p data-en="These terms describe how dumpster rentals from JP Roll Off Service, Inc. (&quot;JP Roll Off,&quot; &quot;we,&quot; &quot;us&quot;) work. Pricing and job-specific details are provided in your quote. If you have a question about anything here, call our office before you book." data-es="Estos términos describen cómo funcionan las rentas de contenedores de JP Roll Off Service, Inc. (&quot;JP Roll Off,&quot; &quot;nosotros&quot;). El precio y los detalles específicos del trabajo se indican en tu cotización. Si tienes alguna pregunta sobre lo que aparece aquí, llama a nuestra oficina antes de reservar.">These terms describe how dumpster rentals from JP Roll Off Service, Inc. (&quot;JP Roll Off,&quot; &quot;we,&quot; &quot;us&quot;) work. Pricing and job-specific details are provided in your quote. If you have a question about anything here, call our office before you book.</p>

        <h2 data-en="1. Quotes and pricing" data-es="1. Cotizaciones y precios">1. Quotes and pricing</h2>
        <p data-en="Pricing depends on the dumpster size and type of material. Your quote includes delivery, pickup, and a 14-day rental. Heavy materials require separate pricing." data-es="El precio depende del tamaño del contenedor y del tipo de material. Tu cotización incluye entrega, recogida y una renta de 14 días. Los materiales pesados requieren un precio por separado.">Pricing depends on the dumpster size and type of material. Your quote includes delivery, pickup, and a 14-day rental. Heavy materials require separate pricing.</p>
        <p data-en="Additional charges may apply for excess weight, prohibited items, extra rental days, and trip charges." data-es="Pueden aplicar cargos adicionales por peso excedente, artículos prohibidos, días de renta adicionales y cargos por viaje.">Additional charges may apply for excess weight, prohibited items, extra rental days, and trip charges.</p>

        <h2 data-en="2. Payment" data-es="2. Pago">2. Payment</h2>
        <p data-en="We accept credit cards, debit cards, and ACH payments. Payment is required before delivery." data-es="Aceptamos tarjetas de crédito, tarjetas de débito y pagos ACH. El pago se requiere antes de la entrega.">We accept credit cards, debit cards, and ACH payments. Payment is required before delivery.</p>

        <h2 data-en="3. Rental period and pickup" data-es="3. Periodo de renta y recogida">3. Rental period and pickup</h2>
        <ul>
          <li data-en="Our standard rental includes 14 days." data-es="Nuestra renta estándar incluye 14 días.">Our standard rental includes 14 days.</li>
          <li data-en="Additional rental days are available for a daily charge." data-es="Hay días de renta adicionales disponibles por un cargo diario.">Additional rental days are available for a daily charge.</li>
          <li data-en="Pickup is on request. Dumpsters are not picked up automatically. Call our office when you are ready and we will add your dumpster to our schedule." data-es="La recogida es a solicitud. Los contenedores no se recogen automáticamente. Llama a nuestra oficina cuando estés listo y agregaremos tu contenedor a nuestro calendario.">Pickup is on request. Dumpsters are not picked up automatically. Call our office when you are ready and we will add your dumpster to our schedule.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 data-en="4. Delivery and access" data-es="4. Entrega y acceso">4. Delivery and access</h2>
        <ul>
          <li data-en="Order by 12 PM for next-day delivery. Same-day delivery may be available depending on your location and our schedule." data-es="Ordena antes de las 12 PM para entrega al día siguiente. La entrega el mismo día puede estar disponible según tu ubicación y nuestro horario.">Order by 12 PM for next-day delivery. Same-day delivery may be available depending on your location and our schedule.</li>
          <li data-en="Our trucks generally require a minimum of 44 feet of straight-line access to safely place a dumpster. We also operate smaller trucks that can accommodate tighter spaces." data-es="Nuestros camiones generalmente requieren un mínimo de 44 pies de acceso en línea recta para colocar un contenedor de forma segura. También operamos camiones más pequeños que pueden adaptarse a espacios más reducidos.">Our trucks generally require a minimum of 44 feet of straight-line access to safely place a dumpster. We also operate smaller trucks that can accommodate tighter spaces.</li>
          <li data-en="Make sure there is adequate overhead clearance from trees, wires, and other obstacles." data-es="Asegúrate de que haya suficiente espacio libre por encima, sin árboles, cables u otros obstáculos.">Make sure there is adequate overhead clearance from trees, wires, and other obstacles.</li>
          <li data-en="If your driveway, alley, or job site has limited access, tell us when scheduling so we can recommend the best option." data-es="Si tu parqueo, callejón u obra tiene acceso limitado, avísanos al programar para recomendarte la mejor opción.">If your driveway, alley, or job site has limited access, tell us when scheduling so we can recommend the best option.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 data-en="5. Placement and surfaces" data-es="5. Colocación y superficies">5. Placement and surfaces</h2>
        <p data-en="Roll-off dumpsters and delivery trucks are heavy and may damage some surfaces. Customers are responsible for protecting their driveway or placement area before delivery. If you&#39;re unsure about placement, call our office before scheduling." data-es="Los contenedores roll-off y los camiones de entrega son pesados y pueden dañar algunas superficies. Los clientes son responsables de proteger su parqueo o área de colocación antes de la entrega. Si no estás seguro sobre la colocación, llama a nuestra oficina antes de programar.">Roll-off dumpsters and delivery trucks are heavy and may damage some surfaces. Customers are responsible for protecting their driveway or placement area before delivery. If you&#39;re unsure about placement, call our office before scheduling.</p>

        <h2 data-en="6. Permits" data-es="6. Permisos">6. Permits</h2>
        <p data-en="Permit requirements depend on where the dumpster will be placed and local regulations. Customers are responsible for determining whether a permit is required and obtaining any necessary permits or approvals before delivery." data-es="Los requisitos de permiso dependen de dónde se colocará el contenedor y de las regulaciones locales. Los clientes son responsables de determinar si se requiere un permiso y de obtener los permisos o aprobaciones necesarios antes de la entrega.">Permit requirements depend on where the dumpster will be placed and local regulations. Customers are responsible for determining whether a permit is required and obtaining any necessary permits or approvals before delivery.</p>

        <h2 data-en="7. Loading rules" data-es="7. Reglas de carga">7. Loading rules</h2>
        <ul>
          <li data-en="For safety and transportation regulations, debris must not extend above the top edge of the container." data-es="Por seguridad y por regulaciones de transporte, los escombros no deben sobrepasar el borde superior del contenedor.">For safety and transportation regulations, debris must not extend above the top edge of the container.</li>
          <li data-en="Aggregate materials such as concrete, dirt, brick, and asphalt must remain 1 foot below the top rail of the container." data-es="Los materiales agregados como concreto, tierra, ladrillo y asfalto deben quedar 1 pie por debajo del riel superior del contenedor.">Aggregate materials such as concrete, dirt, brick, and asphalt must remain 1 foot below the top rail of the container.</li>
          <li data-en="Overfilled containers cannot be legally hauled and will not be picked up until the level is reduced." data-es="Los contenedores sobrellenados no pueden transportarse legalmente y no se recogerán hasta que se reduzca el nivel.">Overfilled containers cannot be legally hauled and will not be picked up until the level is reduced.</li>
          <li data-en="Weight limits depend on the container size and material type." data-es="Los límites de peso dependen del tamaño del contenedor y del tipo de material.">Weight limits depend on the container size and material type.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 data-en="8. Accepted materials" data-es="8. Materiales aceptados">8. Accepted materials</h2>
        <p data-en="Most household junk, construction debris, demolition debris, furniture, roofing materials, and yard debris are accepted." data-es="Se acepta la mayoría de la basura del hogar, escombros de construcción, escombros de demolición, muebles, materiales de techo y desechos de jardín.">Most household junk, construction debris, demolition debris, furniture, roofing materials, and yard debris are accepted.</p>
        <p data-en="Concrete, dirt, asphalt, brick, and masonry require a designated 10-, 15-, or 20-yard aggregate dumpster and must be kept separate from general trash. They are not accepted in 25-, 30-, or 40-yard dumpsters." data-es="El concreto, la tierra, el asfalto, el ladrillo y la mampostería requieren un contenedor de agregados designado de 10, 15 o 20 yardas y deben mantenerse separados de la basura general. No se aceptan en contenedores de 25, 30 o 40 yardas.">Concrete, dirt, asphalt, brick, and masonry require a designated 10-, 15-, or 20-yard aggregate dumpster and must be kept separate from general trash. They are not accepted in 25-, 30-, or 40-yard dumpsters.</p>

        <h2 data-en="9. Prohibited items and additional charges" data-es="9. Artículos prohibidos y cargos adicionales">9. Prohibited items and additional charges</h2>
        <ul>
          <li data-en="We do not accept hazardous materials, paint, oils, fuels, chemicals, batteries, propane tanks, asbestos, or refrigerators containing refrigerant." data-es="No aceptamos materiales peligrosos, pintura, aceites, combustibles, químicos, baterías, tanques de propano, asbesto ni refrigeradores con refrigerante.">We do not accept hazardous materials, paint, oils, fuels, chemicals, batteries, propane tanks, asbestos, or refrigerators containing refrigerant.</li>
          <li data-en="Mattresses and tires are accepted for an additional charge." data-es="Los colchones y las llantas se aceptan por un cargo adicional.">Mattresses and tires are accepted for an additional charge.</li>
          <li data-en="Not sure about an item? Call us before loading." data-es="¿No estás seguro sobre un artículo? Llámanos antes de cargar.">Not sure about an item? Call us before loading.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 data-en="10. Trip charges, cancellations, and rescheduling" data-es="10. Cargos por viaje, cancelaciones y reprogramaciones">10. Trip charges, cancellations, and rescheduling</h2>
        <ul>
          <li data-en="If the container can&#39;t be delivered or picked up as scheduled because the site is blocked or inaccessible, or the container is overfilled, a trip charge applies." data-es="Si el contenedor no puede entregarse o recogerse según lo programado porque el sitio está bloqueado o inaccesible, o el contenedor está sobrellenado, aplica un cargo por viaje.">If the container can&#39;t be delivered or picked up as scheduled because the site is blocked or inaccessible, or the container is overfilled, a trip charge applies.</li>
          <li data-en="Please contact us as soon as possible if your plans change. Orders canceled or rescheduled before dispatch are generally not subject to additional fees." data-es="Contáctanos lo antes posible si cambian tus planes. Las órdenes canceladas o reprogramadas antes del despacho generalmente no están sujetas a cargos adicionales.">Please contact us as soon as possible if your plans change. Orders canceled or rescheduled before dispatch are generally not subject to additional fees.</li>
          <li data-en="If the truck has already been dispatched or is on-site, a trip charge will apply." data-es="Si el camión ya fue despachado o está en el sitio, aplicará un cargo por viaje.">If the truck has already been dispatched or is on-site, a trip charge will apply.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 data-en="11. Changes to these terms" data-es="11. Cambios a estos términos">11. Changes to these terms</h2>
        <p data-en="We may update these terms from time to time. We will post the updated terms on this page and update the &quot;Last updated&quot; date." data-es="Podemos actualizar estos términos de vez en cuando. Publicaremos los términos actualizados en esta página y actualizaremos la fecha de &quot;Última actualización&quot;.">We may update these terms from time to time. We will post the updated terms on this page and update the &quot;Last updated&quot; date.</p>

